d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834520/extras/5d61d65487528d295a9b8a19326769db.poster.avif?t=1754999150\" width=616 height=382 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834520/extras/5d61d65487528d295a9b8a19326769db.webm?t=1754999150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2834520/extras/5d61d65487528d295a9b8a19326769db.mp4?t=1754999150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br>Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dynamic difficulty \ud83d\udc49 so you can relax or go as hard as you want!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >roguelike \ud83d\udc49 unlock maps, secrets, musics, characters and enemies across runs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore \ud83d\udc49 maps can be moved through to find pickups or secrets!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique enemies\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 all enemies have unique abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >choose your length\u00a0\ud83d\udc49 engage in short sessions or in endless mode!</p></li></ul>",
